# Rust
/target
Cargo.lock  # Uncomment if this is a library project
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Tauri build artifacts — gen/schemas/*.json is regenerated on every
# `cargo build --features gui` / `cargo tauri build`, so tracking it
# just produces noisy diffs. CI rebuilds from source, doesn't read the
# committed copy.
gen/schemas/

# Autogenerated by tauri-build from the AppManifest::commands list in
# build.rs (allow-<command> permissions for the GUI IPC ACL). Same deal
# as gen/schemas: regenerated on every gui build, never read from a
# committed copy.
/permissions/

